        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-254 (ensure controlled execution — Stock Transfers &amp; Rebalancing (PA-05.2).) | - operational: Supply Planner review and approval gate
Owner: Supply Planner</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
