        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-254 (ensure controlled execution — Stock Transfers &amp; Rebalancing (PA-05.2).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: Store Manager (Store A)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
